<title>UK: IBCA rates Uniao De Bancos Brasileiros CPs.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates Uniao De Bancos Brasileiros CPs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, has assigned a short-term rating of B to the commercial paper programme of Unibanco - Uniao de Bancos Brasileiros SA Grand Cayman Branch.</p>
<p>Unibanco is the third largest private sector financial group in Brazil, providing a full range of commercial and investment banking and financial services.</p>
</text>
